WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Lend me your head

2
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:17,890
You really agreed just now

3
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,090
It's not easy to kill a poor warrior

4
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,710
It would be better to wait until he lets his guard down, not to mention

5
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,190
Already promised to you

6
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:26,550
Of course we have to do it

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:28,590
It's for Nian Nian, right? Gu Shiyi

8
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:31,190
You planned him that way because

9
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,660
He's your only family, right?

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,020
Nian Nian is home

11
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,150
Master said there is no home

12
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,470
There is no difference between alive and dead

13
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:41,110
Your master is right

14
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:43,110
Everyone wants me dead

15
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,200
Only Niannian can't

16
00:00:45,840 --> 00:01:00,240
From now on, I won’t leave either. The road ahead is long and I can’t delay Yunjiang.

17
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,500
The entire Jianghu family is half an officialdom

18
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:04,260
Everyone started chasing that kid.

19
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,500
He really can withstand it

20
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,660
If you can't even survive in the world of martial arts

21
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:10,620
Then there is no need to take over the Northern Territory.

22
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:11,780
Brother Gu won’t die

23
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:14,610
He will become stronger and more terrifying

24
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,410
Wait until you see him next time

25
00:01:16,990 --> 00:01:18,630
You will know what fear is
